        "created_at": "2022-05-14T12:10:38.686Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not sure how recently you’ve beaten Progeny in the digital version (or if you have it), but there is a depiction of the head once you beat him:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b3a01c5ad7cafaf0cbd7d5471a4b9c93532d92ea.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/b3a01c5ad7cafaf0cbd7d5471a4b9c93532d92ea\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b3a01c5ad7cafaf0cbd7d5471a4b9c93532d92ea_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pD2vbhh3XlT8OCLabiXLFCJps1Q\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b3a01c5ad7cafaf0cbd7d5471a4b9c93532d92ea_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b3a01c5ad7cafaf0cbd7d5471a4b9c93532d92ea_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b3a01c5ad7cafaf0cbd7d5471a4b9c93532d92ea_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b3a01c5ad7cafaf0cbd7d5471a4b9c93532d92ea_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 173 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I point this out not to prevent what you’re doing, but to give you another reference in case you haven’t seen it.</p>",
